sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant A as FastAPI (auth)
    participant P as Protected route
    C->>A: POST /login (email + password)
    A->>A: verify password (bcrypt)
    A-->>C: JWT access token (ký bằng SECRET)
    Note over C: lưu token, gửi kèm mỗi request
    C->>P: GET /me (Authorization: Bearer token)
    P->>P: get_current_user() verify chữ ký + hạn
    P-->>C: dữ liệu user (200) hoặc 401 nếu token sai/hết hạn
